# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Documentation & Markdown Policy (Phase 16)
# Only root README.md and the public verification audit report are tracked on GitHub.
# All internal markdown reports, phase audits, research docs remain local only.
*.md
*/**/*.md
!/README.md
!/SECURITY_AND_PRIVACY_AUDIT.md

# Internal security reports & research directories
docs/security/
docs/research/
